OL,3,GNEWSACabinet councillor steps aside
OL,4,Aamid police inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has stepped away
OL,7,Ffrom his cabinet role, according to a
OL,8,Fcouncil leader, after concerns were
OL,9,Fraised over his alleged arrest.
OL,11,FThe leader of North East Lincolnshire
OL,12,FCouncil, Oliver Freeston, said
OL,13,FCouncillor James Sawkins would "step
OL,14,Faway" as he "continues to grieve the
OL,15,Floss of his father".
OL,17,FOn Friday, local Labour MP Melanie Onn
OL,18,Fwrote to the chairman of Reform UK over
OL,19,FSawkins' involvement in an "ongoing
OL,20,Fpolice investigation".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
