OL,3,GNEWSACabinet councillor steps aside
OL,4,Aamid police inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, Freeston said: "I
OL,7,Funderstand that Councillor Sawkins has
OL,8,Fnot been charged with an offence, and
OL,9,Fthat the allegations concern a third
OL,10,Fparty. Councillor Sawkins therefore
OL,11,Fremains a Reform UK councillor but is
OL,12,Fstepping away from Cabinet."
